From: Andrey Pavlenko <andrey.a.pavlenko@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 21:21:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [MLIR][XeVM] Fallback to Level Zero based compilation if
 ocloc not found

If neither the libocloc nor ocloc tool is found, fallback to L0-based
compilation to binary.
---
